note right of SprintPlanningPage
Outside ProjectLayoutPage: workspace =
workspaceResource(() => GetWorkspaceQuery) for the
breadcrumb; its name goes to SprintPlanView and the
dialogs. A workspace 404 shows Project not found with
Back to projects.
SprintPlanView.refresh = refreshCount(); remove and add
(query parameters from the work delete dialog and
Backlog Add to sprint) pass as preMarkedRemoval and
preMarkedAddition when each is a well-formed story ID;
a malformed value is ignored. editRequested -> openEdit();
startRequested -> openStart().
SprintFormOutcome: Saved -> refreshCount + 1 and
"Changes saved" toast; ModeChanged, Outdated ->
refreshCount + 1 (the header is reread).
StartSprintOutcome: Started -> open the board with the
"Sprint 9 started" toast; ModeChanged, Outdated ->
refreshCount + 1; CloseSprint(sprint) ->
openCloseSprint(sprint.sprintId), offerSprintsLink = true.
CloseSprintOutcome: Closed -> open its history with the
"Sprint 8 closed" toast; Outdated -> refreshCount + 1.
planSaved -> "Sprint planned" toast. A dialog's
unconfirmed -> refreshCount + 1 at once. The view's or
a dialog's forbidden -> "Your access changed" toast,
without Retry. retryRequested ->
workspace.reload() and refreshCount + 1.
draft combines the view's latest draftChange with the
open dialog's draft: dirty, pending or unconfirmed when
either is, summary naming both. UnsavedChangesGuard is
the canDeactivate and
also runs when sprintId changes (Back to another plan),
after which an open dialog closes with no result.
end note
