note right of SprintFormDialog
close(Saved(result)) on saved; close(ModeChanged)
when it closes after modeChanged; close(Outdated)
when it closes after outdated, or at once on
notFound; close() on Cancel means dismissed.
Relays the form's unconfirmed and forbidden as its
own outputs and stays open with the draft.
requestClose on a dirty draft opens
UnsavedChangesDialog (CancelForm).
end note
